# Human logic: the user's own rules for DECK BUILDING, deck balance (PC vs NPC) and Forge AI improvement. Nothing else is recorded here.
# Claude-only file in TOON (pipe-delimited table; # lines are comments). Read before building, judging or testing decks, or proposing AI changes. When a rule conflicts with a metric, the rule wins.
# status: applied = in code or decks now, partly = some of it done, open = not done or not decided. since = date the user said it.
# Add a row only for user input on deck building, deck balance or AI improvement (town, map, quest and UI rules live in the design docs). Pruned 2026-10-21 at the user's request.
rules[35|]{id|area|rule|since|status|where}:
  H01|curve|A zone's stage locks at the player's first fight there from Seals held (0-1 stage 1, 2-3 stage 2, 4-5 stage 3)|2026-10-20|applied|TierLock.java and config tierLock
